    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for fast-paced, <i>strategic</i> combat in <strong>Mordeny</strong>, a thrilling <i>2D top-down shooter</i> where quick reflexes and <i>tactical thinking</i> are your best weapons.  Explore unique <i>gamemodes</i> and customize your own character as you unlock new <i>abilities</i> and gear.  Whether you're battling solo or teaming up with friends, <strong>Mordeny</strong> offers an action-packed adventure like no other where every battle demands precision and skill. Join the fight and experience the thrill today!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for fast-paced, <i>strategic</i> combat in <strong>Mordeny</strong>, a thrilling <i>2D top-down shooter</i> where quick reflexes and <i>tactical thinking</i> are your best weapons.  Explore unique <i>gamemodes</i> and customize your own character as you unlock new <i>abilities</i> and gear.  Whether you're battling solo or teaming up with friends, <strong>Mordeny</strong> offers an action-packed adventure like no other where every battle demands precision and skill. Join the fight and experience the thrill today!</p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into Mordeny, a fast-paced 2D top-down shooter! Unlock abilities, customize your character, and battle through unique game modes. Whether solo or with friends, each fight demands skill and precision. Join the action today!",
